1362
01:32:51,280 --> 01:32:52,114
Meu Deus.

1363
01:32:54,241 --> 01:32:55,242
O que aconteceu com...

1364
01:32:55,409 --> 01:32:56,243
Camilla...

1365
01:32:56,827 --> 01:32:57,995
Lucas...

1366
01:33:00,330 --> 01:33:01,790
O que aconteceu com o...

1367
